  @case 'freeze (parked host): the trill output is authored and the host leaves the stash'  [harness]  @ 2052-2089
  @case 'freeze (on-take host): the cc curve is authored and the host keeps its note'  [harness]  @ 2093-2119
  @case 'freeze (host parked by a region): the chain goes, the note stays parked'  [harness]  @ 2125-2144
  @case 'freeze declines on a plain note and changes nothing'  [harness]  @ 2148-2158
  @case 'park windows: a self-parking note host contributes one window, not two'  [harness]  @ 2166-2184
  @case 'park windows: a self-parking note host runs its chain once, not twice'  [harness]  @ 2190-2207
  @case 'freeze gate (overlapping regions): neither freezes, and nothing changes'  [harness]  @ 2215-2235
  @case 'freeze gate (identical-window neighbour): mutual same-target overlap refuses both'  [harness]  @ 2241-2261
  @case 'freeze gate (abutting windows): pb refuses on the shared boundary, cc does not'  [harness]  @ 2267-2290
  @case 'freeze gate (covered fx host): the region waits for the host it parks'  [harness]  @ 2296-2313
  @case 'freeze gate (inverse): a note-dest host under a region note window is refused'  [harness]  @ 2319-2333
  @case 'freeze (disjoint same-target neighbour): the survivor keeps its window and its curve'  [harness]  @ 2339-2358
  @case 'freeze gate (two stages, one target): a chain does not refuse itself'  [harness]  @ 2364-2372
  @case 'freeze gate (staged host pending): freeze settles the take before reading the census'  [harness]  @ 2380-2397
  @case 'freeze eligibility: the map moves with rebuild'  [harness]  @ 2403-2419
  @case 'freeze to group: the dense curve re-seats sparse in one flush'  [harness]  @ 2427-2442
  @case 'freeze to group: the members come back in the authored frame'  [harness]  @ 2448-2480
  @case 'freeze to group: a surviving breakpoint keeps its identity across a take reload'  [harness]  @ 2486-2501
  @case 'freeze to group: a curved macro freezes exact'  [harness]  @ 2507-2520
  @case 'freeze to group declines on a plain note and changes nothing'  [harness]  @ 2524-2533

